WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.454 --> 00:00:02.569
- Always been people have been taught

00:00:02.569 --> 00:00:04.652
that they must work hard.

00:00:06.038 --> 00:00:08.571
Nobody told them they must work joyfully.

00:00:08.571 --> 00:00:11.188
Most human beings have
crippled themselves.

00:00:11.188 --> 00:00:12.862
Simply because of fear of suffering.

00:00:12.862 --> 00:00:14.013
What will happen to me?

00:00:14.013 --> 00:00:15.130
Is always the question.

00:00:15.130 --> 00:00:17.807
Every idea, every thought, every emotion

00:00:17.807 --> 00:00:20.270
every value that you have

00:00:20.270 --> 00:00:22.138
is picked up from somewhere

00:00:22.138 --> 00:00:24.338
and it rules you from within.

00:00:24.338 --> 00:00:25.959
- He's a man whose passion spills

00:00:25.959 --> 00:00:27.713
into everything he encounters.

00:00:27.713 --> 00:00:29.176
He infects his zest for life

00:00:29.176 --> 00:00:32.558
into all those who seek to
live their life to the fullest.

00:00:32.558 --> 00:00:35.595
He's the author of Inner
Engineering: A Yogis Guide to Joy

00:00:35.595 --> 00:00:37.649
which is a New York
Times best selling book.

00:00:37.649 --> 00:00:39.312
He is Sadhguru and here is my take

00:00:39.312 --> 00:00:42.124
on his top ten rules
for success, volume two.

00:00:42.124 --> 00:00:44.153
And as always guys, as
you're watching the videos

00:00:44.153 --> 00:00:46.317
if you hear something that
really resonates with you

00:00:46.317 --> 00:00:48.134
please leave it down in the comments below

00:00:48.134 --> 00:00:49.011
and put quotes around it

00:00:49.011 --> 00:00:50.892
so other people can be inspired as well.

00:00:50.892 --> 00:00:53.035
Also, as you are writing something down

00:00:53.035 --> 00:00:56.165
it's much more likely to
stick in your head too.

00:00:56.165 --> 00:00:56.998
Enjoy.

00:01:00.127 --> 00:01:03.544
(upbeat inspiring music)

00:01:10.431 --> 00:01:12.931
- You can live life with ease.

00:01:14.088 --> 00:01:15.588
Not with struggle.

00:01:16.596 --> 00:01:19.096
One thing is, when we say work

00:01:20.473 --> 00:01:23.427
it's many young people, wonderful people

00:01:23.427 --> 00:01:26.519
who are getting recognized for whatever

00:01:26.519 --> 00:01:28.943
wonderful things they have done.

00:01:28.943 --> 00:01:32.462
Leaving them apart but
generally work means

00:01:32.462 --> 00:01:34.642
always been people have been taught

00:01:34.642 --> 00:01:36.725
that they must work hard.

00:01:38.016 --> 00:01:41.136
Nobody told them they must work joyfully.

00:01:41.136 --> 00:01:44.236
Nobody told them that work should be

00:01:44.236 --> 00:01:47.761
an expression of their joy or their life.

00:01:47.761 --> 00:01:49.611
They have to work hard.

00:01:49.611 --> 00:01:52.747
You work hard, life will be tedious.

00:01:52.747 --> 00:01:54.414
How else will it be?

00:01:56.852 --> 00:01:58.248
You will do something hard

00:01:58.248 --> 00:02:01.675
only because you don't know how to do it.

00:02:01.675 --> 00:02:04.874
If you know how to do it,
you will do it with ease.

00:02:04.874 --> 00:02:08.911
So without learning how to do
something if you try to do it

00:02:08.911 --> 00:02:11.882
without investing enough
time and perception

00:02:11.882 --> 00:02:13.999
if life is all expression

00:02:13.999 --> 00:02:16.188
than life becomes a big struggle.

00:02:16.188 --> 00:02:17.785
Not a single day passes for me.

00:02:17.785 --> 00:02:18.618
- [Woman] Right.

00:02:18.618 --> 00:02:21.238
- Without witnessing tears
of joy and love around me.

00:02:21.238 --> 00:02:22.071
Every day.

00:02:22.937 --> 00:02:26.435
Somebody will be shedding
tears of love and joy.

00:02:26.435 --> 00:02:28.472
I don't think there's a better way to live

00:02:28.472 --> 00:02:29.305
in this world.

00:02:29.305 --> 00:02:31.388
(laughs)

00:02:32.591 --> 00:02:33.779
And all of us should strive

00:02:33.779 --> 00:02:34.900
to create our own circles

00:02:34.900 --> 00:02:38.317
of joyfulness and pleasantness around us.

00:02:39.191 --> 00:02:43.108
Because if you're not
joyful by your own nature

00:02:44.103 --> 00:02:48.750
if you're always going around
with the fear of suffering

00:02:48.750 --> 00:02:51.775
as long as fear of suffering
is there within you

00:02:51.775 --> 00:02:54.816
you will never walk your
life with full stride.

00:02:54.816 --> 00:02:56.944
It will always be half a step.

00:02:56.944 --> 00:02:59.657
Most human beings have crippled themselves

00:02:59.657 --> 00:03:01.428
simply because of fear of suffering.

00:03:01.428 --> 00:03:02.523
What will happen to me?

00:03:02.523 --> 00:03:04.603
Is always the question.

00:03:04.603 --> 00:03:06.773
Whatever happens, this is how I will be.

00:03:06.773 --> 00:03:08.682
If this assurance comes to you

00:03:08.682 --> 00:03:11.642
only now you will want to
scale the peaks of life

00:03:11.642 --> 00:03:13.998
and see what about it.

00:03:13.998 --> 00:03:16.451
If it happens, makes no difference to you.

00:03:16.451 --> 00:03:19.031
If it doesn't happen,
makes no difference to you.

00:03:19.031 --> 00:03:21.223
That's when you would like to

00:03:21.223 --> 00:03:23.928
really explore every dimension of life.

00:03:23.928 --> 00:03:26.246
So first and foremost thing is this

00:03:26.246 --> 00:03:29.306
that your way of being is not determined

00:03:29.306 --> 00:03:30.836
by what's around you.

00:03:30.836 --> 00:03:32.957
If you bring this one aspect to you

00:03:32.957 --> 00:03:34.703
there is no fear of suffering.

00:03:34.703 --> 00:03:36.562
Once there is no fear of suffering

00:03:36.562 --> 00:03:39.900
you will traverse the breadth
and length of this life.

00:03:39.900 --> 00:03:41.394
Without hesitation.

00:03:41.394 --> 00:03:43.527
When the result of the event

00:03:43.527 --> 00:03:45.901
has no impact on you.

00:03:45.901 --> 00:03:47.982
Both ways you're blissed out.

00:03:47.982 --> 00:03:49.399
You're a success.

00:03:51.919 --> 00:03:54.252
When the fruit of the action

00:03:56.134 --> 00:03:58.634
does not determine how you are

00:03:59.557 --> 00:04:01.624
it's just that you do things

00:04:01.624 --> 00:04:04.957
because of the exuberance of what you do

00:04:05.837 --> 00:04:07.704
then you are a success.

00:04:07.704 --> 00:04:11.311
The result may depend
on variety of things.

00:04:11.311 --> 00:04:13.868
Results are not always yours.

00:04:13.868 --> 00:04:15.876
For any result to happen

00:04:15.876 --> 00:04:18.336
whether it's in a game
or in life situations

00:04:18.336 --> 00:04:20.172
there are various factors involved

00:04:20.172 --> 00:04:22.688
not all of it is in our control.

00:04:22.688 --> 00:04:25.087
But what is in our control

00:04:25.087 --> 00:04:27.034
is either we did our best

00:04:27.034 --> 00:04:28.970
or we did not do our best.

00:04:28.970 --> 00:04:30.481
That's in our control.

00:04:30.481 --> 00:04:32.910
As long as we're doing that

00:04:32.910 --> 00:04:35.521
and whatever the result may be

00:04:35.521 --> 00:04:37.816
if you're still blissed out

00:04:37.816 --> 00:04:39.309
that means you are a success

00:04:39.309 --> 00:04:41.876
because life cannot defeat you anymore.

00:04:41.876 --> 00:04:42.959
Being playful

00:04:45.979 --> 00:04:49.896
always has been understood
as irresponsibility.

00:04:51.667 --> 00:04:53.043
Yes?

00:04:53.043 --> 00:04:55.429
Do you know, right from your childhood

00:04:55.429 --> 00:04:57.367
and probably to your children.

00:04:57.367 --> 00:04:58.510
They're just playful.

00:04:58.510 --> 00:05:01.727
You think it's irresponsible.

00:05:01.727 --> 00:05:03.748
The most responsible way to live

00:05:03.748 --> 00:05:06.227
is that you're playful with life.

00:05:06.227 --> 00:05:08.273
It's absolutely irresponsible

00:05:08.273 --> 00:05:12.364
to carry a long face and
walk around on this planet.

00:05:12.364 --> 00:05:13.197
Yes or no?

00:05:14.779 --> 00:05:16.847
Isn't it absolutely irresponsible

00:05:16.847 --> 00:05:19.097
to walk around with misery?

00:05:20.707 --> 00:05:21.860
Yes.

00:05:21.860 --> 00:05:25.777
That's the most irresponsible
thing you can do.

00:05:27.107 --> 00:05:30.998
So being playful is not irresponsibility

00:05:30.998 --> 00:05:34.468
being playful is being very responsible

00:05:34.468 --> 00:05:36.235
and responsive to life.

00:05:36.235 --> 00:05:38.498
Only when you are
playful, you can do that.

00:05:38.498 --> 00:05:41.611
When you are serious, the
world doesn't exist for you.

00:05:41.611 --> 00:05:43.444
You and your nonsense.

00:05:44.523 --> 00:05:45.662
Yes.

00:05:45.662 --> 00:05:47.982
When you are silly it's just
about you and your nonsense.

00:05:47.982 --> 00:05:50.840
The world and other life
does not exist for you.

00:05:50.840 --> 00:05:52.359
Only when you are playful.

00:05:52.359 --> 00:05:54.878
You can pay attention to everything.

00:05:54.878 --> 00:05:57.340
You can truly respond to
everything in the world

00:05:57.340 --> 00:05:59.027
only if you're playful

00:05:59.027 --> 00:06:01.194
otherwise you cannot.

00:06:01.194 --> 00:06:03.395
Just a burden, enough it will kill you.

00:06:03.395 --> 00:06:06.145
- How to conquer fear on the body

00:06:07.728 --> 00:06:10.221
on the way to success.

00:06:10.221 --> 00:06:11.221
That is all.

00:06:12.625 --> 00:06:17.475
- Okay, fear about whether I
would be successful or not?

00:06:17.475 --> 00:06:19.892
Where does that fear come in?

00:06:21.083 --> 00:06:22.922
Your individual fear about
will I be successful or not?

00:06:22.922 --> 00:06:25.339
Is that what you are talking?

00:06:27.180 --> 00:06:30.079
I think that's exactly what I
have been telling you till now

00:06:30.079 --> 00:06:32.495
don't even think of success.

00:06:32.495 --> 00:06:34.202
Just enhance your capabilities.

00:06:34.202 --> 00:06:36.702
Strive to enhance who you are.

00:06:37.611 --> 00:06:40.998
And what you can do you
will never do, resent it.

00:06:40.998 --> 00:06:44.165
Right now, you have an idea of success

00:06:45.180 --> 00:06:48.454
but you don't have the
competence for that.

00:06:48.454 --> 00:06:49.552
You want to go somewhere

00:06:49.552 --> 00:06:52.750
but you don't have the legs to get there.

00:06:52.750 --> 00:06:54.338
Now naturally there will be fear.

00:06:54.338 --> 00:06:55.469
Naturally there will be all kinds

00:06:55.469 --> 00:06:58.374
of unnecessary struggles and emotions.

00:06:58.374 --> 00:07:00.128
Accept that at this stage in your life

00:07:00.128 --> 00:07:03.427
if you just focus on seeing how to enhance

00:07:03.427 --> 00:07:05.472
this human being to the
highest possible level

00:07:05.472 --> 00:07:06.472
that you can

00:07:08.288 --> 00:07:12.374
success will be a downhill
run not an uphill task.

00:07:12.374 --> 00:07:14.523
So if you are going downhill

00:07:14.523 --> 00:07:16.649
there is no fear isn't it?

00:07:16.649 --> 00:07:18.411
Because whether I can get there or not

00:07:18.411 --> 00:07:19.910
whether I can get there or not

00:07:19.910 --> 00:07:24.871
you are working towards
somebody elses idea of success.

00:07:24.871 --> 00:07:27.738
You are working towards
somebody elses idea of success.

00:07:27.738 --> 00:07:29.145
That is not success.

00:07:29.145 --> 00:07:32.650
Your successes, you as a human being

00:07:32.650 --> 00:07:34.310
you found your full potential.

00:07:34.310 --> 00:07:36.314
This is your success.

00:07:36.314 --> 00:07:38.319
And that's all you can do.

00:07:38.319 --> 00:07:40.995
Whether you stand on your head
or you stand on your feet.

00:07:40.995 --> 00:07:42.729
The best that you can do.

00:07:42.729 --> 00:07:45.826
If this human being finds
his fullest potential

00:07:45.826 --> 00:07:47.451
that's all you can do.

00:07:47.451 --> 00:07:48.691
No matter what you do

00:07:48.691 --> 00:07:51.001
you cannot do more isn't it?

00:07:51.001 --> 00:07:54.308
Certain circumstances
sometimes will loft us up.

00:07:54.308 --> 00:07:56.820
Certain circumstances sometimes may not.

00:07:56.820 --> 00:07:58.961
But in the given circumstance

00:07:58.961 --> 00:08:00.786
if you have blossomed
to your fullest level

00:08:00.786 --> 00:08:02.953
you will do well isn't it?

00:08:05.394 --> 00:08:07.928
Don't think of success
and be fearful about it.

00:08:07.928 --> 00:08:09.187
Just see how to make this one

00:08:09.187 --> 00:08:11.571
more and more capable.

00:08:11.571 --> 00:08:14.361
If the competence and capability is there

00:08:14.361 --> 00:08:16.588
success will come as we deserve it.

00:08:16.588 --> 00:08:19.474
All of human experiences
generate from within.

00:08:19.474 --> 00:08:20.772
Is that so?

00:08:20.772 --> 00:08:23.885
All human experiences
generated from within.

00:08:23.885 --> 00:08:27.692
So at any time, if you
feel happy or unhappy

00:08:27.692 --> 00:08:30.240
miserable, joyful, excited

00:08:30.240 --> 00:08:31.907
in a state of agony.

00:08:33.163 --> 00:08:34.907
It doesn't matter what happens.

00:08:34.907 --> 00:08:36.237
What is your experience?

00:08:36.237 --> 00:08:38.908
Pleasantness or unpleasantness?

00:08:38.908 --> 00:08:42.422
Just to know that it's
happening from within.

00:08:42.422 --> 00:08:45.398
And it can only happen from within.

00:08:45.398 --> 00:08:48.619
You can either take external stimuli

00:08:48.619 --> 00:08:51.147
or you can create your own stimuli

00:08:51.147 --> 00:08:54.397
but essentially it happens from within.

00:08:55.720 --> 00:08:58.951
This one thing if it is not grasped

00:08:58.951 --> 00:09:02.986
when you feel miserable,
if you think it's this one

00:09:02.986 --> 00:09:03.986
you're gone.

00:09:05.183 --> 00:09:07.933
You're just, the keyboard is here

00:09:08.979 --> 00:09:11.396
but you're punching the wall.

00:09:12.955 --> 00:09:14.865
It's not going to work.

00:09:14.865 --> 00:09:17.145
This one basic fundamental thing

00:09:17.145 --> 00:09:19.924
is something that almost
90% of the humanity

00:09:19.924 --> 00:09:22.606
is always doing it wrong.

00:09:22.606 --> 00:09:24.468
Whenever they feel miserable

00:09:24.468 --> 00:09:26.384
they think it must be this one or that one

00:09:26.384 --> 00:09:28.384
or that one or that one.

00:09:31.605 --> 00:09:32.778
No.

00:09:32.778 --> 00:09:36.361
All human experiences
generate from within.

00:09:37.731 --> 00:09:40.735
If something is feeling unpleasant

00:09:40.735 --> 00:09:43.268
first thing is to look at this.

00:09:43.268 --> 00:09:45.379
What am I doing wrong with this?

00:09:45.379 --> 00:09:48.004
Am I eating wrong, am I sleeping wrong

00:09:48.004 --> 00:09:50.046
am I sitting wrong, am I breathing wrong

00:09:50.046 --> 00:09:51.698
is my heart beating wrong?

00:09:51.698 --> 00:09:52.531
Something.

00:09:53.536 --> 00:09:55.593
My chemistry is wrong.

00:09:55.593 --> 00:09:59.260
Something is wrong with
this, not with that.

00:10:01.503 --> 00:10:04.955
So the moment you think
by kicking the wall

00:10:04.955 --> 00:10:06.622
you can fix this one

00:10:07.541 --> 00:10:10.469
then you made a fundamental mistake.

00:10:10.469 --> 00:10:14.561
The harder you try, the
further away from it you go.

00:10:14.561 --> 00:10:17.470
The first thing is to bring balance.

00:10:17.470 --> 00:10:20.329
Once there is balance,
then you can build a tower

00:10:20.329 --> 00:10:21.826
on top of this.

00:10:21.826 --> 00:10:23.654
If there is no balance

00:10:23.654 --> 00:10:26.760
whatever you build will
only lead to more trouble.

00:10:26.760 --> 00:10:29.379
The more basic you are, the better it is.

00:10:29.379 --> 00:10:32.320
So this is what a whole
lot of humanity is seeking

00:10:32.320 --> 00:10:34.237
somehow to remain basic

00:10:35.187 --> 00:10:37.759
because if you build
something, it feels terrible

00:10:37.759 --> 00:10:41.017
then there is no fundamental balance.

00:10:41.017 --> 00:10:45.418
Anything standing up without
balance is a big problem.

00:10:45.418 --> 00:10:47.773
It is somebodys idea

00:10:47.773 --> 00:10:50.171
of what is success isn't it?

00:10:50.171 --> 00:10:53.207
Don't become a slave to somebodys idea.

00:10:53.207 --> 00:10:55.540
At least have your own idea.

00:10:58.683 --> 00:11:01.618
You have no idea of your own

00:11:01.618 --> 00:11:03.221
don't deceive yourself.

00:11:03.221 --> 00:11:05.939
Every idea, every thought, every emotion

00:11:05.939 --> 00:11:08.514
every value that you have

00:11:08.514 --> 00:11:10.399
is picked up from somewhere

00:11:10.399 --> 00:11:13.381
and it rules you from within.

00:11:13.381 --> 00:11:15.603
It rules you from within.

00:11:15.603 --> 00:11:19.018
Your religion, your society, your culture

00:11:19.018 --> 00:11:22.601
has trained you to
believe that this is it.

00:11:26.348 --> 00:11:29.348
So the first and foremost success is

00:11:31.576 --> 00:11:35.116
that you are not a slave to anybodys idea.

00:11:35.116 --> 00:11:37.022
This is success.

00:11:37.022 --> 00:11:40.533
If you come to the idea
of mortality once in a way

00:11:40.533 --> 00:11:43.130
it will make you depressed.

00:11:43.130 --> 00:11:45.017
It will make you fearful.

00:11:45.017 --> 00:11:47.375
If you live with it every moment

00:11:47.375 --> 00:11:51.194
it will make you absolutely
exuberant and alive

00:11:51.194 --> 00:11:54.027
because it is just this one thing.

00:11:58.644 --> 00:12:01.069
That this is not forever.

00:12:01.069 --> 00:12:03.703
This is just for a brief period of time.

00:12:03.703 --> 00:12:07.778
And the more joyful you
are, briefer it becomes.

00:12:07.778 --> 00:12:11.103
If you're ecstatic, it
will just vanish in no time

00:12:11.103 --> 00:12:12.340
(laughs)

00:12:12.340 --> 00:12:13.940
Yes?

00:12:13.940 --> 00:12:15.177
So if you want to stretch it

00:12:15.177 --> 00:12:17.574
you need to make yourself truly miserable.

00:12:17.574 --> 00:12:19.401
(audience laughs)

00:12:19.401 --> 00:12:22.746
Otherwise, it will be
just gone in no time.

00:12:22.746 --> 00:12:25.961
If you come to terms with this

00:12:25.961 --> 00:12:27.576
if you live this way

00:12:27.576 --> 00:12:31.358
that every moment you
appreciate one thing.

00:12:31.358 --> 00:12:32.612
And only one thing

00:12:32.612 --> 00:12:35.525
because the most important
thing in your life

00:12:35.525 --> 00:12:39.282
is you're alive right now, to be alive.

00:12:39.282 --> 00:12:41.688
Fully alive, 100% alive

00:12:41.688 --> 00:12:43.140
is the most important thing

00:12:43.140 --> 00:12:47.228
because only if something is 100% alive

00:12:47.228 --> 00:12:49.815
can you make it in something beautiful.

00:12:49.815 --> 00:12:53.477
A human being does not become who he is

00:12:53.477 --> 00:12:55.219
because of his desire.

00:12:55.219 --> 00:12:59.379
He becomes who he is
because of his competence.

00:12:59.379 --> 00:13:01.371
So by enhancing your competence

00:13:01.371 --> 00:13:03.536
you're just enhancing your desire

00:13:03.536 --> 00:13:08.028
which will be just as horrible
burden to carry all the time.

00:13:08.028 --> 00:13:11.631
You just focus on enhancing
the competence of who this is

00:13:11.631 --> 00:13:13.408
rather than enhancing your desire

00:13:13.408 --> 00:13:15.482
that I'm going to become a world champion.

00:13:15.482 --> 00:13:16.973
Everybody wants to become one

00:13:16.973 --> 00:13:19.640
they're not going to become one isn't it?

00:13:19.640 --> 00:13:21.317
Everybody wants to be successful

00:13:21.317 --> 00:13:24.422
they will not be a success
unless you do the right things.

00:13:24.422 --> 00:13:27.564
Success will not happen to you.

00:13:27.564 --> 00:13:28.872
Can I tell you a joke?

00:13:28.872 --> 00:13:30.546
(audience laughs)

00:13:30.546 --> 00:13:33.429
45 minutes, you've got to be serious.

00:13:33.429 --> 00:13:34.723
- A joke now?

00:13:34.723 --> 00:13:35.556
- We can?

00:13:36.409 --> 00:13:37.403
- Okay.

00:13:37.403 --> 00:13:39.268
Tell me the joke.

00:13:39.268 --> 00:13:41.634
Okay let me ask you this question.

00:13:41.634 --> 00:13:42.994
- Well let me tell you a joke.

00:13:42.994 --> 00:13:46.143
(audience laughs)

00:13:46.143 --> 00:13:47.310
- Even better.

00:13:51.459 --> 00:13:55.626
- On a certain day, a man
fell into a septic tank.

00:13:57.211 --> 00:13:59.378
Right up to here in filth.

00:14:02.651 --> 00:14:06.189
He desperately tried to
come out, he could not.

00:14:06.189 --> 00:14:09.577
Then he started screaming, "Fire, fire!"

00:14:09.577 --> 00:14:11.996
Neighbors heard this,
called the fire brigade.

00:14:11.996 --> 00:14:13.746
Firemen came rushing.

00:14:14.686 --> 00:14:16.861
They looked all over the place, no fire.

00:14:16.861 --> 00:14:18.385
Then they found this man.

00:14:18.385 --> 00:14:19.836
They pulled him out and they asked

00:14:19.836 --> 00:14:21.322
"Why were you screaming fire?

00:14:21.322 --> 00:14:23.321
"Where is the fire?"

00:14:23.321 --> 00:14:26.217
The man retorted, "If I said
shit, shit, would you come?"

00:14:26.217 --> 00:14:28.653
(laughing)

00:14:28.653 --> 00:14:30.455
You got to do the right things

00:14:30.455 --> 00:14:32.436
otherwise right things
will not happen to you.

00:14:32.436 --> 00:14:34.597
Just because you have a big desire

00:14:34.597 --> 00:14:35.887
you're not going to get there.

00:14:35.887 --> 00:14:38.035
You have to do the right things.

00:14:38.035 --> 00:14:41.177
Rarely is situations in your life

00:14:41.177 --> 00:14:42.927
either you can use it

00:14:46.308 --> 00:14:49.999
to make yourself stronger and better

00:14:49.999 --> 00:14:52.137
or you can sit and cry.

00:14:52.137 --> 00:14:54.359
This is the choice you have.

00:14:54.359 --> 00:14:58.212
Everything, it doesn't matter what happens

00:14:58.212 --> 00:15:02.305
the most horrific event
happened in your life

00:15:02.305 --> 00:15:05.624
that also can be used for your growth

00:15:05.624 --> 00:15:06.960
and your well being.

00:15:06.960 --> 00:15:09.723
If only, if you have clearly seen

00:15:09.723 --> 00:15:11.865
the small events of your life.

00:15:11.865 --> 00:15:14.652
When I say small events,
I mean your business

00:15:14.652 --> 00:15:17.444
your marriage, your children,
all those big things.

00:15:17.444 --> 00:15:20.732
(audience laughs)

00:15:20.732 --> 00:15:23.731
All these things are just a stepping stone

00:15:23.731 --> 00:15:25.648
so the fear of failure.

00:15:30.305 --> 00:15:32.194
Failure is bad enough.

00:15:32.194 --> 00:15:34.908
Fear is adding spice to it isn't it?

00:15:34.908 --> 00:15:36.991
(laughs)

00:15:39.569 --> 00:15:43.569
Success happens to you
not because you desire it

00:15:44.466 --> 00:15:46.133
because you earn it.

00:15:48.135 --> 00:15:50.697
Everybody desires it.

00:15:50.697 --> 00:15:53.864
It comes only if you're capable of it.

00:15:55.598 --> 00:15:57.050
- Thank you guys so much for watching.

00:15:57.050 --> 00:16:00.177
We're continuing in this series
of the volume two episode

00:16:00.177 --> 00:16:01.675
so I'd love to know what you guys think

00:16:01.675 --> 00:16:03.391
and if there's anybody
you want to nominate

00:16:03.391 --> 00:16:05.574
for volume two, let me know.

00:16:05.574 --> 00:16:06.765
I'm also really curious to figure out

00:16:06.765 --> 00:16:08.568
what did you learn from Sadhguru today

00:16:08.568 --> 00:16:10.866
that had the biggest
impact on you and why?

00:16:10.866 --> 00:16:12.016
What message did you take

00:16:12.016 --> 00:16:13.663
that you're going to immediately apply

00:16:13.663 --> 00:16:15.799
somehow to your life or to your business.

00:16:15.799 --> 00:16:17.256
Leave it down in the comments below

00:16:17.256 --> 00:16:19.006
and I'm going to join in the discussion.

00:16:19.006 --> 00:16:21.077
Finally, I want to give a quick
shout-out to Rhonda Young.

00:16:21.077 --> 00:16:23.008
Rhonda, thank you so much for your support

00:16:23.008 --> 00:16:25.033
in buying my book Your One Word.

00:16:25.033 --> 00:16:27.676
I really, really, really,
really appreciate it.

00:16:27.676 --> 00:16:30.259
(upbeat music)

00:16:49.236 --> 00:16:50.477
So thank you guys again for watching.

00:16:50.477 --> 00:16:51.603
I believe in you.

00:16:51.603 --> 00:16:53.349
I hope you continue to believe in yourself

00:16:53.349 --> 00:16:55.434
and whatever your one word is.

00:16:55.434 --> 00:16:57.851
Much love, I'll see you soon.

00:17:13.402 --> 00:17:14.860
- Winning an election.

00:17:14.860 --> 00:17:16.663
(audience laughs)

00:17:16.663 --> 00:17:18.365
- [Man] If you want to win an election

00:17:18.365 --> 00:17:21.115
that's how luck is also incurred.

00:17:22.703 --> 00:17:24.786
(laughs)

00:17:27.761 --> 00:17:28.928
- Pray to God.

00:17:30.912 --> 00:17:31.995
Luck, effort.

00:17:35.563 --> 00:17:37.063
Maybe all of them?

00:17:40.004 --> 00:17:41.921
But in what proportion?

00:17:43.531 --> 00:17:45.371
So when you say faith

00:17:45.371 --> 00:17:47.453
obviously it's something
that you cannot do

00:17:47.453 --> 00:17:49.365
anything about.

00:17:49.365 --> 00:17:51.873
When you say luck, again
obviously it's something

00:17:51.873 --> 00:17:53.851
that you cannot do anything about.

00:17:53.851 --> 00:17:56.255
When you say God, again it's something

00:17:56.255 --> 00:17:58.876
that you cannot do anything about.

00:17:58.876 --> 00:18:01.984
So the only thing in your hands is effort.

00:18:01.984 --> 00:18:04.716
So put 100% into your effort

00:18:04.716 --> 00:18:07.263
what happens, happens isn't it?

00:18:07.263 --> 00:18:09.859
(applause)

00:18:09.859 --> 00:18:12.534
But don't leave proportions of your energy

00:18:12.534 --> 00:18:15.777
and your capability to luck, God, faith

00:18:15.777 --> 00:18:16.810
all those things.

00:18:16.810 --> 00:18:18.705
That's not your business
if there is such a thing

00:18:18.705 --> 00:18:20.022
it will act.

00:18:20.022 --> 00:18:22.802
Your business is only effort isn't it?

00:18:22.802 --> 00:18:23.885
Just do that.

00:18:25.776 --> 00:18:28.859
Effort has to be incisive in a sense.

00:18:30.358 --> 00:18:33.108
It should be focused, calibrated.

00:18:34.269 --> 00:18:36.351
Simply if you make effort

00:18:36.351 --> 00:18:39.001
it's foolish effort isn't it?

00:18:39.001 --> 00:18:42.401
Just labor is not going
to get you somewhere.

00:18:42.401 --> 00:18:44.650
The right kind of action, the right timing

00:18:44.650 --> 00:18:48.317
right place, all this
is important isn't it?

00:18:52.677 --> 00:18:55.427
So for all these things to happen

00:18:57.392 --> 00:19:00.475
you need perception and intelligence.

00:19:01.496 --> 00:19:04.432
So that's all you must do in your life.

00:19:04.432 --> 00:19:09.037
Constantly looking for ways
to enhance your perception

00:19:09.037 --> 00:19:10.374
and your intelligence.

00:19:10.374 --> 00:19:12.707
The rest will anyway happen.

00:19:15.145 --> 00:19:19.390
This is one thing that
unfortunately humanity is not doing.

00:19:19.390 --> 00:19:23.327
They're trying to become
capable of something.

00:19:23.327 --> 00:19:26.667
Do not try to become capable of something.

00:19:26.667 --> 00:19:29.331
Just enhance your
perception and intelligence.

00:19:29.331 --> 00:19:31.506
Whatever comes your way.

00:19:31.506 --> 00:19:35.017
Right now, let us say it's like this

00:19:35.017 --> 00:19:39.184
you know, this is happening
in the world all the time.

00:19:41.637 --> 00:19:44.554
Everybody wants to become a doctor.

00:19:46.498 --> 00:19:49.081
Not now, if 25 years it was so.

00:19:50.334 --> 00:19:52.840
If you wanted to study,
first thing is medicine.

00:19:52.840 --> 00:19:56.725
If you don't get a seat, what's next?

00:19:56.725 --> 00:19:58.558
Engineering.

00:19:58.558 --> 00:20:00.475
Don't get a seat, what?

00:20:01.485 --> 00:20:04.991
Next thing, next thing, like this.

00:20:04.991 --> 00:20:08.375
So let's say you became a doctor

00:20:08.375 --> 00:20:10.040
and let us say

00:20:10.040 --> 00:20:11.776
everybody came to a yoga program

00:20:11.776 --> 00:20:14.609
and they stopped going to a doctor

00:20:15.895 --> 00:20:19.639
at least your visits to the
doctor has come down isn't it?

00:20:19.639 --> 00:20:20.472
Has it?

00:20:21.880 --> 00:20:23.312
Has it come down or not?

00:20:23.312 --> 00:20:25.037
For sure, it's come down.

00:20:25.037 --> 00:20:27.120
So business will go down.

00:20:28.604 --> 00:20:32.225
It will no more be a good
profession to go into

00:20:32.225 --> 00:20:34.840
because very few doctors
are becoming doctors

00:20:34.840 --> 00:20:37.091
because they want to become doctors.

00:20:37.091 --> 00:20:39.079
Others are becoming doctors because

00:20:39.079 --> 00:20:41.246
they think it's lucrative.

00:20:42.428 --> 00:20:43.261
Isn't it?

00:20:44.482 --> 00:20:46.249
Isn't it so?

00:20:46.249 --> 00:20:48.127
Most people are becoming doctors because

00:20:48.127 --> 00:20:52.294
they think somebodys sickness
is a lucrative business.

00:20:54.454 --> 00:20:57.577
It's very, I don't want to
go into all the aspects.

00:20:57.577 --> 00:20:59.509
It's quite disturbing for me.

00:20:59.509 --> 00:21:02.334
(laughs)

00:21:02.334 --> 00:21:05.638
There are few doctors who
really want to be that.

00:21:05.638 --> 00:21:07.580
They want to understand the human system

00:21:07.580 --> 00:21:10.923
and they want to serve in that direction.

00:21:10.923 --> 00:21:12.006
That's great.

00:21:15.399 --> 00:21:18.149
Suppose everybody became healthy.

00:21:19.852 --> 00:21:22.269
You don't want that isn't it?

00:21:24.642 --> 00:21:26.309
You don't want that.

00:21:27.218 --> 00:21:30.351
So do not try to put up a recipe

00:21:30.351 --> 00:21:31.768
for your success.

00:21:33.970 --> 00:21:38.834
Success is only when you
are able to use yourself

00:21:38.834 --> 00:21:40.751
to your full potential.

00:21:42.117 --> 00:21:45.099
It doesn't matter whether
you become a doctor

00:21:45.099 --> 00:21:46.382
or a politician

00:21:46.382 --> 00:21:48.962
or a yogi, or what the hell you become.

00:21:48.962 --> 00:21:49.961
It's not the thing.

00:21:49.961 --> 00:21:53.128
Success means you are living your life

00:21:54.009 --> 00:21:56.638
to your full potential.

00:21:56.638 --> 00:21:58.588
That's what success means.

00:21:58.588 --> 00:21:59.864
If that has to happen

00:21:59.864 --> 00:22:03.467
you need perception and
an active intelligence.

00:22:03.467 --> 00:22:05.808
How do I grow my intelligence?

00:22:05.808 --> 00:22:07.535
Don't worry about that.

00:22:07.535 --> 00:22:08.974
Right now, the important thing

00:22:08.974 --> 00:22:11.808
is to enhance your perception.

00:22:11.808 --> 00:22:14.848
If you're able to see
life just the way it is

00:22:14.848 --> 00:22:18.896
you have the necessary
intelligence to conduct it well.

00:22:18.896 --> 00:22:21.889
If you're not able to
see life the way it is

00:22:21.889 --> 00:22:25.456
your intelligence will work against you.

00:22:25.456 --> 00:22:28.577
Most intelligent people on this planet

00:22:28.577 --> 00:22:32.744
are generally the most
miserable people on the planet.

00:22:34.070 --> 00:22:35.602
This is simple because

00:22:35.602 --> 00:22:37.372
they have an active intelligence

00:22:37.372 --> 00:22:39.539
but no perception of life.

00:22:41.062 --> 00:22:43.024
So, one thing.

00:22:43.024 --> 00:22:44.772
One most important thing

00:22:44.772 --> 00:22:46.437
that people have not worked at

00:22:46.437 --> 00:22:48.502
is to enhance their perception.

00:22:48.502 --> 00:22:51.160
They're trying to broaden their mind.

00:22:51.160 --> 00:22:53.486
That's not the point.

00:22:53.486 --> 00:22:56.520
That will only make you
socially successful.

00:22:56.520 --> 00:22:58.481
Not truly successful.

00:22:58.481 --> 00:23:00.737
If you want to be truly successful

00:23:00.737 --> 00:23:02.643
you must be able to see everything

00:23:02.643 --> 00:23:04.707
just the way it is.

00:23:04.707 --> 00:23:06.450
Without distortions.

00:23:06.450 --> 00:23:08.863
If you can see everything
just the way it is

00:23:08.863 --> 00:23:10.531
life becomes a play.

00:23:10.531 --> 00:23:12.376
You can play joyfully

00:23:12.376 --> 00:23:14.876
you can play it well for sure.

00:23:16.879 --> 00:23:19.160
If you can play it well

00:23:19.160 --> 00:23:21.056
people will say you're successful.

00:23:21.056 --> 00:23:24.466
You should never think,
"I want to be successful."

00:23:24.466 --> 00:23:28.146
Don't ever think, "I
want to be successful."

00:23:28.146 --> 00:23:30.466
Just see how to make this being

00:23:30.466 --> 00:23:32.883
into your full fledged being.

00:23:33.720 --> 00:23:36.330
People will say one day,
"Oh he's successful.

00:23:36.330 --> 00:23:38.458
"He's a great success."

00:23:38.458 --> 00:23:41.003
You should not be aspiring for success

00:23:41.003 --> 00:23:44.793
it's a miserable way
to structure your life.

00:23:44.793 --> 00:23:48.244
You will simply cause pain
and suffering to yourself

00:23:48.244 --> 00:23:50.283
and suffering to everybody

00:23:50.283 --> 00:23:51.878
because your idea of success is sitting

00:23:51.878 --> 00:23:54.711
on top of somebodys head isn't it?

00:23:55.888 --> 00:23:57.281
Yes or no?

00:23:57.281 --> 00:23:59.539
Your idea of successes right now

00:23:59.539 --> 00:24:01.018
everybody should be below you

00:24:01.018 --> 00:24:02.628
you must be at the top.

00:24:02.628 --> 00:24:04.110
This is your idea of success.

00:24:04.110 --> 00:24:07.277
This is not success, this is sickness.

00:24:09.293 --> 00:24:11.884
So do not ever think of success.

00:24:11.884 --> 00:24:16.051
Just see how to make this
into your full fledged being.

00:24:17.155 --> 00:24:19.189
This is will find expression.

00:24:19.189 --> 00:24:20.771
If it finds good expression

00:24:20.771 --> 00:24:22.615
people around you will say

00:24:22.615 --> 00:24:25.236
"Oh he is a great success."

00:24:25.236 --> 00:24:26.952
That's fine.

00:24:26.952 --> 00:24:28.982
People should recognize your success.

00:24:28.982 --> 00:24:32.677
You should not be thinking
how to be successful.

00:24:32.677 --> 00:24:34.556
Very wrong way to approach life.

